  <item>
    <title>乱讲Ep.06浅聊哈佛蒋雨融，精英人设的信仰崩塌？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68459e3a6dbe9284e76712b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68459e3a6dbe9284e76712b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>蒋雨融，中国女孩，哈佛毕业典礼上的一颗明珠</span></p><span></span><p><span>但却收到了极大的光芒反噬</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期请到了多名美国名校“精英”，就此次事件，以及“精英教育”展开激烈辩论，你支持哪一方？评论区来和我们互动吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：现役创业者兼哈佛学姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：前纽约交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Paul：前斯坦佛精英</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> &nbsp;正方：再光鲜的皮囊掩盖不住空洞的灵魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 反方：你难道小时候没有“大爱”过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 正方：没有亲身经历，不足信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 反方：那你亲身经历过啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> 好听点叫共情，难听点叫圣母</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> 正方：说白了，这个人就是不真诚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 反方：那也值得全民骂战吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 我会比她更有勇气吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a> 中华大民族</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 精英教育，此一时彼一时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> 《身份的焦虑》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2626">43:46</a> “精英”也不是一成不变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> 德不配位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> 精英的帽子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3356">55:56</a> 事情的症结，叫做没满足预期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">58:01</a> 有罪推论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3807">1:03:27</a> 谁是蒋雨融，谁都有罪</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码6/15日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIkulfBV3e1cA2QilEjqZIcZh-Q.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63cfd5c8d2fc61ba52fe5d21/ljnD2d4w9SLCism13j-r9KkjhU6I.m4a" length="63951169" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyKTmWk0Uv7mv73nLqbF1-gTMgk.jpg"/>
