  <item>
    <title>正说Ep.05 今天你跨境了没？白手起家跨境老鸟说说掏心窝子的话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682f5025fcbc2e206b45fcde</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682f5025fcbc2e206b45fcde</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>他是第一批tiktok骨灰级玩家，无互联网经验直接从零起号</span></p><span></span><p><span>他是行业官方认证讲师，出版从业书籍影响十万人</span></p><span></span><p><span>他说他没有秘籍，直接把跨境攻略掰开揉碎给你看</span></p><span></span><p><span>那，你要看吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：现役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：前纽交trader，现生活coser</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sky老思：跨境“老鸟”，也是很多tiktok从业者的精神导师</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 行业里的老思，行业里的老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 是什么风刮上了跨境的贼船？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 跨境现在算不算爆冷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 讲真，why you？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 不出国做跨境是不是一个伪命题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> 跨境圈的幸存者们，是什么人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 关于“关税”，别讲官话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 国内国外看待贸易摩擦的不同视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 不出海，是不是也不会出局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2424">40:24</a> 现在出海，还迟吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2589">43:09</a> 出海，好货，便宜，不能共存的三个字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2794">46:34</a> AI+出海，实际应用咋样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3154">52:34</a> IP和品牌，不是不想做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3364">56:04</a> 结语：给走过路过的一些建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，Sky老师的超链接：</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号搜索《Sky老思》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63cfd5c8d2fc61ba52fe5d21/ln9UamNoEf_rHApbzxnA3KW-kM7o.m4a" length="56679202" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyKTmWk0Uv7mv73nLqbF1-gTMgk.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>乱讲Ep.05 在裁员大潮下，当代孔乙己们要不要脱下长衫？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6479e4b41672628240bc67ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6479e4b41672628240bc67ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Jun 2023 15:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>增长增长，红利红利</span></p><span></span><p><span>如此生活十年，直到大厦崩塌</span></p><span></span><p><span>当孔乙己们失去了俸禄和庇护</span></p><span></span><p><span>那一件长衫便显得多余了起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：前纽约交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>小昭：大厂小兵</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> &nbsp;当代孔乙己们，又要面子又要里子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 说白了还是人设的包袱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 你有多少作的空间？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 时间久了，长衫或许会长在身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 在经济认知面前，人类衣不遮体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 换个角度说，孔乙己脱不脱长衫，可能是酒馆的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 最难受的人，是看过辉煌的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 老一辈的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 裁员潮之下，什么样子的人能留下来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">28:52</a> 留下来的人老十岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a> 裁的是人还是事儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">34:48</a> “卷”其实是管理者的黑暗森林法则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> 反卷可以从局部“小公司”开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 棋子的觉悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2951">49:11</a> Cordy总结：没有坏选择，只有信息不对称</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3072">51:12</a> 腿毛总结：逆行者最帅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">53:33</a> 小昭总结：管它刮风下雨，我的路线不变</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《忙碌的理发店》——李想</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠嗑群：</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码6/9日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FodGu0qz1W1odZBiCOnq41714feJ.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvpaHHLzKomm74nER9oj1IimYpH8.m4a" length="54476256" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyKTmWk0Uv7mv73nLqbF1-gTMgk.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>正说Ep.04 黄连之后，白水回甘，做一个不普通的普通人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64395ff19361a4e7c38ebbba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64395ff19361a4e7c38ebbba</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Apr 2023 14:15:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一个精通算法和数学理论的天才</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个不修边幅，插上发髻的另类</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个内心平和，与巨人站在一起的普通人</span></p><span></span><p><span>这三种形容在他身上，完美融为了一体</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>李火火：前大厂产品经理</span></p><span></span><p><span>NP：大厂算法大牛</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> &nbsp;理科生之痛，无关对错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 火火：反对别人的反对很有快感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> Cordy：当年冷门，现在热门是一种什么感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 文艺范儿之罪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 语文这种能力，打工人必备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 现代人的矫情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> 矫情之后，永恒不变的是judge别人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 豆瓣上有个小组，叫做吵架没发挥好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> 骂人的本质，是对他人的优越感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a> 斜杠青年没有未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 火火：换赛道是因为你真的喜欢？还是因为只想逃避</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a> 别人如何找到自己所爱？关键是你找了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> Cordy：垂直技能的尽头，是管理和圈层</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">39:58</a> NP：管理是人生观的成熟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">41:58</a> 火火：管理不管理那只是选择而已</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> 这世界不存在哪个年龄应该干嘛的唯一答案，我就是案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 内心世界的强大，是应对平庸的利刃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 和强大的心灵一起经历这个悲惨世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3203">53:23</a> 抖音和快餐式阅读只会让你产生懂了的错觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3317">55:17</a> 黄连之后，白水回甘</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我想Part 2》——法老</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠嗑群：</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码4/21日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhFdl1JzXhoCi2sDlkX7jvN9rlOd.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmh5NEhAI1dj0ujVIxj2WJtxuU04.m4a" length="56305841" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyKTmWk0Uv7mv73nLqbF1-gTMgk.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>乱讲Ep.04从今天开始，我想做一个只关注自我的混蛋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642432ee179eec5331aa2ae1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642432ee179eec5331aa2ae1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Mar 2023 12:45:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>萨特说：“他人即地狱”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为每个人都以自己的欲望和眼光对待一切，因此任何人都会受到其他人的欲望和眼光的干预而变得不自由和痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对干预，有些人消沉否定，自我怀疑直至破碎</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有些人奋起反抗，张开防御见人就咬</span></p><span></span><p><span>而我们只是凡人，如何在地狱修行呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期还是熟悉的味道，本期回归了主播三人，来一起侃侃自我觉醒之路</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：退役纽约金融交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>李火火：前大厂产品经理</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> &nbsp;自我和Ego</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> 心理测试：沙漠中的立方体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 腿毛的自我觉醒之路：全靠他人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> 火火的自我觉醒之路：我比天大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 尊重还是不尊重，这是个是本能还是修养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 我的愤怒是因为别人踩了我的尾巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 自我是自信的梯子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a> 火火自保秘籍：杀敌1000，自损800</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> Cordy自残秘籍：越在意的人伤我越深</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 愤怒也看对象的，对象一变，情绪全无</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">47:20</a> 越是温文尔雅的人，路怒症越严重？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3144">52:24</a> 我们都是在找适合自己的舔伤方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 小自我，好朋友和不够棒</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Windy》——Leebada</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠嗑群：</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码4/5日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQqxoXj8cbMuGQCQHhJimXDJB2g.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnUFsQscl_olADXax2yPJh4PC5Mr.m4a" length="65708457" type="audio/mp4"/>
