  <item>
    <title>正说Ep.03由ChatGPT带来的下世纪技术革命，你真的懂吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6419c05473768bea350ca8c7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6419c05473768bea350ca8c7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Mar 2023 14:33:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你看到了漫天遍地有关ChatGPT的新闻报道</span></p><span></span><p><span>你看到了一个个令人赞叹，妙语连珠的互动回答</span></p><span></span><p><span>你好奇，你惊叹，你担忧，你甚至产生了一点点恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span>你想起来，人类相对于宇宙，可能还是太渺小了</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：退役纽约金融交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>NP：大隐隐于市的算法大牛</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> &nbsp;人间行走的模型机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> 那一天，人们回忆起了蒸汽机革命带来的冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">6:17</a> GPT的迭代，2-3-4不仅仅是数字那么简单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">8:34</a> &nbsp;通用型模型的全面胜利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 你以为它只能对话吗？不，它是全方位的进化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> 作为普通人，我们可以做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a> 为什么社交网络让人上瘾？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 他们在说技术底层，摘要君跟不上了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> 技术诞生往往伴随着“战争”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a> 不懂就问，中国输了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2968">49:28</a> 人工神经网络vs大脑皮层</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3197">53:17</a> 如果机器说谎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">54:50</a> Suggestion Time</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集书单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟李沐学AI</span></p><span></span><p><span>《盲视》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《海伯利安》</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《NIGHT DANCER》——imase</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠嗑群：如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细（本二维码3/28日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjmrKPklyyWj1p47mRm72aESbJAN.png"></figure>]]></description>
