  <item>
    <title>正说Ep.02 告别一地鸡毛的投资圈，他在重新获得生命后找回自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fdb64ab91c17e69c77b8a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63fdb64ab91c17e69c77b8a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一路扮演着“别人家孩子”的角色</span></p><span></span><p><span>在快要失去生命的时刻，我意识到我不要过他们的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>虚无吞噬了我，我却和寂寞成为了朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>在不断思考过后，有了自己的小彻小悟</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：退役纽约金融交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ray：看过繁华，也历经劫难的前一级投资人</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a> &nbsp;不像投资人的投资人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> Enlighten是不是有点装逼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">6:24</a> 据说投资是老年人的活动，年轻的投资人不认</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a> &nbsp;看人看不准，这是每一个人的难题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">13:21</a> 投不一样的聪明人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 在快要失去生命的时刻，我意识到我不要过他们的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 时间是虚无的敌人，亦是朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 挫折，这是个可大可小的词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> Fact，Opinion and Temper</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> 英雄气短&amp;感恩回路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 乔布斯说的每一句话你都听得懂，但你无法体会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 告别投资圈：我不要做给别人孩子辅导作业的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2414">40:14</a> 联络不是怕马屁，而是三人行必有我师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 如何找到自己的毕生所爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2789">46:29</a> “我寂寞寂寞就好”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">51:29</a> 有些大彻大悟，是灵机一现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3234">53:54</a> Suggestion Time</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集书单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>jordan peterson 人生十二法则</span></p><span></span><p><span>《第一性原理与创业》张首晟&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>“爱自己，是终身浪漫的开始”。纪录片<stutz>（施图茨的疗愈之道）</stutz></span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Atlantis》——Seafret</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠嗑群：</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码3/7日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwECSQXSJzt0G8cMUBPQwWDhxSS.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsQ2N66wdEduPfOPl9vLV7_L8aXd.m4a" length="55934991" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyKTmWk0Uv7mv73nLqbF1-gTMgk.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
