  <item>
    <title>正说Ep01.36岁成功退出两次的连续创业者：创业者精神与大厂打工没有本质矛盾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f2f1a20d7e8eaa72049ffe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f2f1a20d7e8eaa72049ffe</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Feb 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>极度自我是他的表现，深度思考是他的本质</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上这句话适用于所有的创业大佬们，包括但不限于乔布斯和马斯克</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，有幸请到了身边的创业巨贵zhenyu，来听听他的人生哲学</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：退役纽约金融交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>zhenyu：36岁成功退出两次的连续创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> &nbsp;偏执，自大，狂妄，奇怪的特质放在他身上顺理成章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 信条就是，不做高考常规题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> 选择创业公司是一道逻辑拆解题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> &nbsp;我接受客观世界对我的客观衡量，不接受客观世界对我的主观评价&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 科学价值观下的拉普拉斯妖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> Alpha male的吸引力法则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> 做的选择不够好，归根结底还是想的不够多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> Positive feedback/成功案例是为了让你知道什么是真正的好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 小团队打大团队，是一场没有阳光的仗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 创业者思维，在大公司有用吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 辩论时间：年轻人要不要去大厂？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">37:56</a> 顶峰企业的发展只有衰退吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2436">40:36</a> 经济下行，我还有什么选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2794">46:34</a> 35岁分界线，36岁表示不服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3199">53:19</a> 应对经济周期和生命周期，不变的是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3417">56:57</a> Suggestion Time</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《不归女孩》——沉舟乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠嗑群：</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码2/27日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr-qXmP-TcGqj1y5D06hKrKWcISJ.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsFHrDbJGWxOdiPrekqmHwcQQEyK.m4a" length="59236955" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyKTmWk0Uv7mv73nLqbF1-gTMgk.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>乱讲Ep.03说话这件事，再伶牙俐齿的人也会有自己的困扰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e7b7990d7e8eaa7267b916</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e7b7990d7e8eaa7267b916</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Feb 2023 15:43:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>说话的艺术，语言的技巧，是一门五年高考三年模拟都没有的超纲题</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是从出生的第一声啼哭，我们就开始用语言表达自己几乎所有需求</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，2位能说会到的主播+1位口齿不清的主持人，来讲讲自己的说话烦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：退役纽约金融交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>李火火：前大厂产品经理</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> &nbsp;小机灵和小结巴，长大以后都可以成为会说话的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 唯独人情世故，和说话的技能无关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> “你怎么不带脑子？”不是每个人都敢说的一句话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 圆生圆，方生方，你是谁就会模仿谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> Cordy困扰时间：我可能是一个没有思想的说话机器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1756">29:16</a> 火火困扰时间：说话不打弯，活到九十九</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 腿毛困扰时间：我是个男人，但是我很啰嗦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">50:13</a> 说话最厉害的人，一定是内外兼修</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3288">54:48</a> 普通人如何准备演讲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3517">58:37</a> 主播心得，毫不啰嗦，干货多多</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期互动：</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于说话，你的困恼/技巧是什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>——留言参与本期话题，来与我们互动吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《不归女孩》——沉舟乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠嗑群：</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码2/18日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjjCsQeRYZHatO_qnvJmz1RpdJ_.png"></figure>]]></description>
