  <item>
    <title>乱讲Ep02.从《狂飙》说起，长大的过程就是变成那个你讨厌的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63de5d8751a4e4150ac27fa7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63de5d8751a4e4150ac27fa7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Feb 2023 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>腿毛：退役纽约金融交易员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>李火火：前大厂产品经理</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> &nbsp;似俗？标准普通话来一遍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> 从《狂飙》讲起，放心吧不带剧透，因为主播也没看完</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a> 主播坦白局：给自己的俗气程度打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 互联网产品和运营互为对方的眼中钉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 从前的理想主义，来的快去的更快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 人生道理和生理年龄互为正比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> 金融知识敲黑板：期权价格与时间价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> 理想主义者更容易跟人吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2582">43:02</a> 年轻，就是打着理想主义的旗帜在狼心狗肺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2696">44:56</a> 鱼和熊掌不可兼得，但只有小孩子才做选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3288">54:48</a> 做一只跳来跳去的狐狸，还是固执坚硬的刺猬？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">01:00:10</a> 四辩总结陈词</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期互动：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你会给自己的理想程度打几分呢？你的分数在过去几年改变过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>——留言参与本期话题，来与我们互动吧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我想part2》——法老/杨秋儒</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>唠嗑群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果想和听友主播们唠唠嗑，也欢迎加入微信群，咱群内细说</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本二维码2/11日前有效）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-svIoP8uHMOBSoqplbyzGjuG-J.png"></figure>]]></description>
