    <title>乱讲Ep01.三十岁的年纪遭遇“停摆”，疯子傻子和哑巴的自言自语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63d3d12b531dadd2b1abeb4c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63d3d12b531dadd2b1abeb4c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Jan 2023 13:27:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时间在走，年纪在走，而我的人生进度却在原地来回摆动</span></p><p><span>闭上双眼，带上耳机，在下个黎明开始之前不如放松放松</span></p><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><p><span>腿毛：退役纽约金融交易员</span></p><p><span>Cordy：退役创业者</span></p><p><span>李火火：前大厂产品经理</span></p><p><strong><span>本期时间线：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 主播乱弹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 主播相识趣事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> “停摆？”一千个人眼中一千个哈姆雷特</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 火火聊停摆：他人即地狱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> Cordy聊停摆：与其反抗不如享受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">27:31</a> MBA能不能不那么“卷”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 我不是不在意，我只是不畏惧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2740">45:40</a> 接受契机，寻找契机，驾驭契机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3383">56:23</a> 从“开会”里学方法论，书中自有黄金屋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">01:01:00</a> 写日记，但不是记录事情，而是情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3815">01:03:35</a> 归纳让人痛苦</span></p><p><strong><span>书单/笔记：</span></strong></p><p><span>《心流》</span></p><p><span>《打开心智》</span></p><p><span>《罗伯特议事规则》</span></p><p><span>《社会心理学》</span></p><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><p><span>《我想part2》——法老/杨秋儒</span></p><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><p><span>645300608@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
